{"id":"b54d75aae768415e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-godel-numbering.md","title":"Gödel编码","display":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-godel-numbering","aliases":["28-df-godel-numbering"],"display":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel编码","depends_on":["[[28-df-formula]]","[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","[[28-df-tm]]"],"source_status":"supplementary-formalization","source_printed_pages":"19","source_pdf_pages":"45"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-godel-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-godel-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"19"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"45"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-godel-numbering-—-Gödel编码-$\\ulcorner-\\cdot-\\urcorner$\">df-godel-numbering — Gödel编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是有效编码的有限签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Expr}_S=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Expr}_S=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ser}_S:\\mathrm{Expr}_S\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{ser}_S:\\mathrm{Expr}_S\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是带构造标签、元数和变量索引的可计算前缀树序列化，配有可计算部分逆 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{parse}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{parse}_S\\)</span>；域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_S)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_S)\\)</span>，且该域可判定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}:\\mathrm{TM}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}:\\mathrm{TM}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是固定单射，采用有限转移表、状态与字母的自分隔列表编码，机器表示的编码、解码与有效性检查均为多项式时间，码长与所列转移表长度彼此多项式有界；元层编码机制固定于此。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(u,v\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_0\\cdots b_{m-1}\\in\\Sigma^m\">\\(b_0\\cdots b_{m-1}\\in\\Sigma^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\">\\(\\langle u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\)</span> 仅用于元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 由调用签名固定的元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。元数作为调用签名的已知参数，不从码串中恢复；各固定元数分别满足单射性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_G(u,v)\\coloneqq1^{|u|}0uv,\\qquad\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,0}()\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,1}(u)\\coloneqq u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pair}_G(u,v)\\coloneqq1^{|u|}0uv,\\qquad\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,0}()\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,1}(u)\\coloneqq u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k+1}(u_1,\\ldots,u_{k+1})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_G(u_1,\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_2,\\ldots,u_{k+1}))\\quad(k\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k+1}(u_1,\\ldots,u_{k+1})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_G(u_1,\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_2,\\ldots,u_{k+1}))\\quad(k\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}: (\\Sigma^*)^k\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad |\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)|=2\\sum_{j=1}^{k-1}|u_j|+|u_k|+k-1\\quad(k\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}: (\\Sigma^*)^k\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad |\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)|=2\\sum_{j=1}^{k-1}|u_j|+|u_k|+k-1\\quad(k\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}(b_0\\cdots b_{m-1})\\coloneqq 2^m-1+\\sum_{i=0}^{m-1}b_i2^{m-1-i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{num}(b_0\\cdots b_{m-1})\\coloneqq 2^m-1+\\sum_{i=0}^{m-1}b_i2^{m-1-i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_S\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}(\\operatorname{ser}_S(e)),\\qquad\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_S\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}(\\operatorname{ser}_S(e)),\\qquad\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{num}\\circ\\operatorname{ser}_S\\},\\qquad\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(e)\\quad(g\\in\\mathrm{GN}_S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GN}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{num}\\circ\\operatorname{ser}_S\\},\\qquad\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(e)\\quad(g\\in\\mathrm{GN}_S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本项固定一个可计算前缀序列化，并定义其规范 Gödel 编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_S\\)</span> 仅记录本约定下的规范编码。编码是显式受约束的元层表示选择，不宣称只凭值域原始递归就能保证编码有效。机器编码是二进制串，公式 Gödel 数是自然数，二者分开；旧定义只要求值域可判定，仍容许不可计算的排列，现已修正。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§1.4，印刷 p.19 / PDF p.45；一阶表达式部分为本地有效编码扩展。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n<p>R7复核：对§1.4（PDF45）的机器转移表表示明确标准多项式编解码要求；一阶表达式的可计算编码扩展、机器码为串/公式码为自然数的区别保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-godel-numbering-—-Gödel编码-$\\ulcorner-\\cdot-\\urcorner$","text":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel编码 $\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d9d9a691a7b0cc03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d9d9a691a7b0cc03","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 是有效编码的有限签名；$\\mathrm{Expr}_S=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S$，see [[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]。\n$\\operatorname{ser}_S:\\mathrm{Expr}_S\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ 是带构造标签、元数和变量索引的可计算前缀树序列化，配有可计算部分逆 $\\operatorname{parse}_S$；域为 $\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_S)$，且该域可判定。$\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}:\\mathrm{TM}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ 是固定单射，采用有限转移表、状态与字母的自分隔列表编码，机器表示的编码、解码与有效性检查均为多项式时间，码长与所列转移表长度彼此多项式有界；元层编码机制固定于此。\n$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$u,v\\in\\Sigma^*$，$\\epsilon$ 为空串，$b_0\\cdots b_{m-1}\\in\\Sigma^m$；$k,m\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{pair}_G$、$\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}$ 由下式定义；$\\langle u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)$ 仅用于元数 $k$ 由调用签名固定的元组，$u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\in\\Sigma^*$。元数作为调用签名的已知参数，不从码串中恢复；各固定元数分别满足单射性。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 是有效编码的有限签名；$\\mathrm{Expr}_S=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S$，see [[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]。\n$\\operatorname{ser}_S:\\mathrm{Expr}_S\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ 是带构造标签、元数和变量索引的可计算前缀树序列化，配有可计算部分逆 $\\operatorname{parse}_S$；域为 $\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_S)$，且该域可判定。$\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}:\\mathrm{TM}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*$ 是固定单射，采用有限转移表、状态与字母的自分隔列表编码，机器表示的编码、解码与有效性检查均为多项式时间，码长与所列转移表长度彼此多项式有界；元层编码机制固定于此。\n$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$u,v\\in\\Sigma^*$，$\\epsilon$ 为空串，$b_0\\cdots b_{m-1}\\in\\Sigma^m$；$k,m\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{pair}_G$、$\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}$ 由下式定义；$\\langle u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)$ 仅用于元数 $k$ 由调用签名固定的元组，$u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\in\\Sigma^*$。元数作为调用签名的已知参数，不从码串中恢复；各固定元数分别满足单射性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Expr}_S=\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ser}_S:\\mathrm{Expr}_S\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{parse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ser}_S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}:\\mathrm{TM}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"b_0\\cdots b_{m-1}\\in\\Sigma^m","display":false},{"tex":"k,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"u_1,\\ldots,u_k\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_G(u,v)\\coloneqq1^{|u|}0uv,\\qquad\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,0}()\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,1}(u)\\coloneqq u.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k+1}(u_1,\\ldots,u_{k+1})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_G(u_1,\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_2,\\ldots,u_{k+1}))\\quad(k\\ge1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}: (\\Sigma^*)^k\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad |\\operatorname{tuple}_{G,k}(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)|=2\\sum_{j=1}^{k-1}|u_j|+|u_k|+k-1\\quad(k\\ge1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{num}(b_0\\cdots b_{m-1})\\coloneqq 2^m-1+\\sum_{i=0}^{m-1}b_i2^{m-1-i}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_S\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}(\\operatorname{ser}_S(e)),\\qquad\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}(M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{num}\\circ\\operatorname{ser}_S\\},\\qquad\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(e)\\quad(g\\in\\mathrm{GN}_S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_S","display":false}],"bytes":3339,"backlinks":[{"id":"01678cd990532be9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"机器有效编码与元组编码见 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$。"},{"id":"89e240fe2a8a5b0c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\ulcorner M\\urcorner$ 与有效二串配对编码见 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"cb0c882121f853e4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；机器有效编码与可解码元组编码来自 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]；四元组采用 $\\langle a,b,c,d\\rangle=\\langle a,\\langle b,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\rangle\\rangle$；$\\operatorname{AccComp}_M,\\operatorname{len}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]；$n,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$1^0=\\varepsilon$。"},{"id":"1b0c7c641c8c6719","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U,M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$M(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\cup\\{\\uparrow\\}$ 的输出/发散由 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 定义。$\\ulcorner M\\urcorner$ 与二串配对来自 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"编码与层级：[[28-df-godel-numbering]]、[[28-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"486528342e0c392b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{ser}_{\\mathrm{TM}}$ 是 [[28-df-godel-numbering]] 固定的可计算、可判定值域机器序列化；$M_0\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 为恒拒绝机。$L(M)$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]。"}],"outgoing":["d9d9a691a7b0cc03","acf90b9de82eb78c","1965e2b0765554c9"]}